  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/58dba590-6e0a-401b-a2ba-377ad2198809-image.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Gatterman Koch reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d827c610-4cfe-438e-93c3-55600d7cd3bd-image.png\" style=\"width: 269px; height: 50px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Etard reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ebef09e3-2eb9-48a5-abc0-947f0e8dc5d3-image.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Stephen reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a6792151-d306-4d05-bb10-008c367b8676-image.png\" style=\"width: 249px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Rosenmund reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
